-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  prj_pack_err_option.pcpp - Projects: pcpp pack takes no build option

  pack builds its packer the one way it needs: -r (or any other option but
  --no-banner and -h) is a bad argument (exit 2), refused before any
  project.toml is read. A cli test (pcpp itself, in the suite's output
  root); this file itself is never compiled.
*******************************************************************************/

module exe prj_pack_err_option;

/*
  @@test
    kind cli
    args "--no-banner pack <DIR> -r"
    exitcode 2
    expect
    | Error: pack takes no -r
    |
    | Run pcpp -h to see available options
  @@end
*/

begin
end.
